{"id":"de5242166047","path":"/en/university/info/alumni","lang":"en","title":"Alumni","description":"Welcome to the USI Alumni section The University, through its Alumni Service, is committed to maintaining relationships with its graduates and aims to strengthen and develop an international and interconnected USI Alumni community.","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Info","Alumni"],"image":null,"words":131,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/alumni","en":"/en/university/info/alumni"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Info","path":"/en/originalnode/14049"},{"label":"Alumni","path":"/en/university/info/alumni"},{"label":"Alumni","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p><strong>Welcome to the USI Alumni section</strong></p> <p>The University, through its <a href=\"/en/originalnode/572\">Alumni Service</a>, is committed to maintaining relationships with its graduates and aims to strengthen and develop an international and interconnected USI Alumni community. It seeks to facilitate contact between alumni and the University, the academic staff, and students, and to enhance the alumni community to support the development of USI.</p> <p>Several activities are organized with and for USI alumni, including:</p> <ul> <li>International Alumni Chapters</li> <li>Program Visiting Alumni and Alumni Talks</li> <li>Alumni Career Stories</li> <li>Alumni Newsletter and Alumni WebNews</li> <li>Alumni Placement Survey</li> </ul><p><strong>Where do USI graduates work? Read their <a href=\"/en/originalnode/663\">Career Stories</a>. This week on the spot:</strong></p><p>Daniele Boschetti</p><p>Associate, Data &amp; AI, Palana, Luxembourg</p><p>USI Degree: Bachelor of Arts in Economics, 2023, Master in Finance, 2025</p><p><a href=\"http://www.careergate.usi.ch/output/CareerSuccessStories/pdf.aspx?idcss=949\"> Read the USI Career Story </a></p>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Alumni","href":"/en/unive